{"id": "1534484668425175060", "channel_id": "1534484668425175060", "author_id": "245917330830393345", "author_name": "ph.d", "content": "For certain texts in the game that has the eldritch effect, a.k.a it converts to gibberish after the line is done, if the autoplay speed is 2x or 4x, the text cuts off sooner than it should. The attached images are screenshots of when the line has finished running. As shown, the text in the 1x autoplay image displays fine, but not in the other two speed.\n\nThis specific example was from Xu's Psyche Deepdive \"Whispers Behind the Fan\", chapter \"Blood of the Sire\". It's the blackened line that plays before Xu?'s line as shown in the screenshot of the log. However, this issue has plagued the game everywhere there's eldritch text, even from the beginning of Faded Legacy.", "timestamp": "2026-08-05T08:54:14.299000+00:00", "thread_id": "1534484668425175060", "attachments": [{"id": "1534484668882223144", "filename": "cropped1ximage.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1301946, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534484668425175060/1534484668882223144/cropped1ximage.png?ex=6a744bb6&is=6a72fa36&hm=8aff7e8df3ee0f6f29b691ac8e0192eef8aa9f503931c17fa07fbc39b8c66dd5&"}, {"id": "1534484669653979186", "filename": "cropped2ximage.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1276917, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534484668425175060/1534484669653979186/cropped2ximage.png?ex=6a744bb6&is=6a72fa36&hm=7bb8a35635e9ebe54eae32c445d1de8e1c1eccfb5a9f87a11b851fa32913c660&"}, {"id": "1534484670140645456", "filename": "cropped4ximage.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1321837, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534484668425175060/1534484670140645456/cropped4ximage.png?ex=6a744bb6&is=6a72fa36&hm=8b54551e2e03afdc1fff561dd748533093c1a3fa9e04c28984dcf7a469f88130&"}, {"id": "1534484670534779041", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 154816, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachme